"shareplay_help" = "SharePlay";
"shareplay_help_body" = "Start or join a FaceTime call, start playback, then choose Start SharePlay in the player. Only the device that starts SharePlay or chooses the channel connects to the IPTV provider. It sends the picture and sound to everyone else through SharePlay, so the others need this app but no playlist or login. URLs and passwords are never sent. The others watch a few seconds behind, and that device’s upload speed limits the stream for everyone. Play and pause are shared; on live TV, play goes back to the live picture. Whoever changes the channel becomes the device that connects. Participants with version 0.2.0 still use their own playlist and login. Minimize and background playback keep SharePlay running. Stop playback leaves the session on this device. Leave SharePlay leaves just you; End for everyone ends the session for all participants. The signed app and its installation profile must include permission for SharePlay group sessions.";
